    "___CONFIDENCE INTERVAL:-\n",
    "-important for hypothesis testing.\n",
    "-its purpose is in population sample.\n",
    "-it helps in finding the precise average value of the poupulation from different samples within a desired range.\n",
    "-it is necessary to find a range to perfom task.\n",
    "-this range is called as the confidence interval.\n",
    "-when we pick 95& or 99% of confidence interval it is the most precise value.\n",
    "-CI= X(bar) +- z. s/uder root of n.\n",
    "    where:-x is mean value, z is value for the confidence interrval it is constant, s is standard deviation, n is sample."
